# Copy this file to .env in the same directory and paste one key per line.
#
#     cp .env.example .env
#
# .gitignore excludes .env, so no key reaches the repository, the Dataverse
# deposit or the shell history file. Every command in this package reads .env
# at import, so a key is typed once and works in every terminal.
#
# A line with no value after the equals sign is ignored, so a provider you have
# no account with can be left exactly as it stands below.
#
# Where each key is issued:
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   console.anthropic.com  ->  API keys
#   OPENAI_API_KEY      platform.openai.com    ->  API keys
#   GEMINI_API_KEY      aistudio.google.com    ->  Get API key
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY    platform.deepseek.com  ->  API keys
#   MOONSHOT_API_KEY    platform.moonshot.ai   ->  API keys
#   ZAI_API_KEY         z.ai                   ->  API keys

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=
ZAI_API_KEY=
